  "name": "CBRFUR",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "CBRFUR was a small furry convention in Canberra, Australia, centered on trips to regional landmarks for fursuit photography. It began as a \"fur car-meet\" with accommodation at Capital Executive Apartments on Northbourne Avenue, and from 2014 it was hosted at the Pavilion on Northbourne hotel. Activities included fursuit walks and photoshoots at Mount Ainslie, Questacon, Telstra Tower, Cockington Green and the Australian National Botanic Gardens, drives and barbecues at the Cotter backroads, and social and VR gaming. The last edition was held in 2018.",
